{"id":"n16718-1-8","stage":2,"title":"쓸다 · 扫","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16718-1-8-1","ko":"밤사이에 집 앞에 눈이 많이 쌓였구나.","zh":"看来夜里房子前面积了好多雪啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밤사이에","meaning":"夜间","explanation":"밤사이：夜间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밤사이","audio":"/audio/36799fdfa2feeb152d3c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57944","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤사이에","audio":"/audio/dff26f887f63ceb2c0f3.mp3"}},{"text":"집","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에","audio":"/audio/6ee410c0325daaa6155d.mp3"}},{"text":"눈이","meaning":"雪","explanation":"눈：雪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20198","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈이","audio":"/audio/6f2474549eb981a98228.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"쌓였구나.","meaning":"堆，叠放，堆积","explanation":"쌓이다：堆，叠放，堆积；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"쌓이다","audio":"/audio/a3671bf3560526d3e4f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65098","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌓이다","origin":